    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order is the Infrastructure Protection (Protected Areas) Order 2026 and comes into operation on 1 April 2026."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2648-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
